@topic concept.native-library
title: Native libraries: `exported c fn` and -emit-native-library
summary: `exported c fn` gives an ordinary Botlish function a C entry point; -emit-native-library NAME builds a static and a shared library, a C header and a JSON manifest that any C host can call.
index: concepts backends
alias: library mode; C export; export to C; exported c fn; native library; emit-native-library; call Botlish from C
keywords: exported, c, named, export, library, static library, shared library, .a, .so, header, manifest, C ABI, embedding, Tcl extension, React Native, instance, thread
related: concept.c-ffi backend.native-executable error.export-signature error.export-capture error.export-symbol error.export-syntax error.native-library cli.options
